Tip content is set via `data-tooltip` - by default they appear above the hovered element, unless that would mean displaying above the top of the viewport, in which case it displays below.

Optionally you can set the tooltip to display to the right of the element via adding a data-attribute of `data-tooltip-direction="right"`.

