It will, by default, show tool tips on the medium and larger breakpoints (medium, large, xlarge and xxlarge). You can optionally set more breakpoints by setting another data attribute, `data-tooltip-breakpoints="large xlarge xxlarge"`; this would only show the tooltip on the requested breakpoints.


